//Modified
```
int size = out.size();
if (size == 0) {
     decodeWasNull = true;
} else if (size == 1) {
     ctx.fireChannelRead(out.get(0));
} else {
         ArrayList<Object> ret = new ArrayList<Object>(size);
         for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) {
            ret.add(out.get(i));
         }
        ctx.fireChannelRead(ret);
}
out.recycle();
```
